(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-27","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["一位老[[seaman|海员]]是织工的[[pal|朋友]]，帮我们把户图[[integration|综合]]起来。院里纸[[windmill|风车]]转着，谁也不希望恐惧[[paralyse|瘫痪]]送水安排。联络员说自己是居民的[[servant|服务者]]，先抱开拴在阀门旁的[[pet|宠物]]。叶澄指出水迹是漏水[[indication|迹象]]，这[[windy|多风的]]天不该仍湿。我们画出安全[[perimeter|边界]]，程雾请孩子回屋。地里没有传说中的黑洞，只是阀门埋得太浅，标签又在日晒雨淋后变了颜色。正是这种普通疏忽，让谁都以为自己只要转一下便足够。","阀门藏在[[shady|荫凉的]]棚下，入口贴着[[pleasant|亲切的]]援助标语。大量[[bulk|大批的]]箱子堆在[[wood|木材]]架旁，[[peripheral|周边的]]水管被它们挡住。门上的旧画里[[sheriff|治安官]]正在保护村民，那是孩子的涂鸦；联络员对援助的[[pride|自豪]]也像孩子一样真诚。老陈让[[coach|长途公共汽车]]停远一点，靠[[wooden|木制的]]撑块稳阀箱。我不拍居民[[personal|私人的]]院子，只拍管口。叶澄终于将基金发来的操作视频删出聊天收藏，重新打开技术手册，不再凭别人演示的方向扳柄。","她的[[shorthand|速记]]说明阀门[[purpose|用途]]是隔断旧沟，关后却还有水。联络员几乎[[despair|绝望]]，林间[[woodpecker|啄木鸟]]敲得他心烦。老陈擦了[[perspiration|汗]]，说标签相似的[[similarity|相似性]]不能保证结构相同。我[[regard|看待]]那幅[[magnificent|壮丽的]]水图的方式变了，它像在[[zebra|斑马]]和[[pineapple|菠萝]]都画满的儿童墙边，假装只是漂亮的一张。可图上少一条旁路，现实便多一户可能受影响的人。叶澄绕到后面，发现有旧式的回流阀，没有列入刚才那份图。","她说不能把工人当[[slavery|奴役]]对象使唤，自己却[[regret|后悔]]当时要求通宵。老陈与维修员[[respectively|分别]]查两端，[[pink|粉红色]]挂牌需要重新[[state|说明]]流向，与真实阀门的[[relation|关系]]已错。撤掉脆弱[[protection|防护]]后，旧[[piston|活塞]]突然卡回；备用[[stationery|文具]]箱掉进沟里。联络员带着[[resentment|怨恨]]责怪叶澄，老陈没加入。他托住后退的维修员，自己肘部撞在撑架上。我看到他嘴唇一白，就把拍照的手放下，先扶住他的身体，证据暂时留在原位。","一[[pint|品脱]]量杯中的水仍在涨，电线[[polarity|极性]]也接反了。手册引用的[[statute|规定]]不能代替此刻停机。我们没[[rush|急冲]]进坑，叶澄在危险一[[instant|瞬间]]切了远端开关。原件[[preservation|保存]]由巡查员负责，老陈呼吸渐渐[[steadily|稳定地]]恢复。程雾把[[sandwich|三明治]]掰给他，设备必须在[[conjunction|连接]]处隔离，才达到事故[[prevention|预防]]要求。叶澄没有用这次帮助抵消以前签过的字，她蹲在老陈面前说对不起，接着转身联系独立维修队，要求替换整段旁路而非再换一张箭头。","供水车来了，居民没有被留下等待另一张漂亮图。叶澄告诉何警官，反向极性不是她的设计，但验收时她没查实便签了。有这句话，明日检查就不能只照她以为正确的图走。老陈的肘没有再次裂开，却要休息，我们把夜探计划取消，改去查地面供电记录。程雾记下旁路断开的准确时刻，我记下居民重新领水的时间。事情在那一刻既变慢也变快：我们得照顾一个真实受伤的人，却终于止住了一条不该继续送水的线。"],"en":["A retired [[seaman|seaman]], the weaver's [[pal|pal]], helped with map [[integration|integration]]. A paper [[windmill|windmill]] turned. Fear should not [[paralyse|paralyse]] delivery. Calling himself residents' [[servant|servant]], the liaison moved a [[pet|pet]] from the valve. Ye identified a leak [[indication|indication]] despite [[windy|windy]] drying weather. We set a [[perimeter|perimeter]] and sent children indoors. Ordinary shallow burial and faded labels made everybody think one turn sufficed.","Under a [[shady|shady]] shed, [[pleasant|pleasant]] aid slogans hung over [[bulk|bulk]] crates on [[wood|wood]] racks concealing [[peripheral|peripheral]] pipes. A child's painted [[sheriff|sheriff]] protected villagers. The liaison's [[pride|pride]] seemed similarly sincere. Chen moved a [[coach|coach]] away and braced the housing with [[wooden|wooden]] blocks. I avoided [[personal|personal]] yards in photographs. Ye discarded a saved demonstration video and opened the technical manual, no longer trusting another person's illustrated turning direction.","Her [[shorthand|shorthand]] gave the valve's [[purpose|purpose]] as ditch isolation, but flow continued after closure. Near [[despair|despair]], the liaison resented a [[woodpecker|woodpecker]]'s noise. Wiping [[perspiration|perspiration]], Chen said label [[similarity|similarity]] did not ensure matching mechanisms. I now [[regard|regard]] the [[magnificent|magnificent]] plan differently: beside children's [[zebra|zebra]] and [[pineapple|pineapple]] drawings it pretended to be another pretty picture. A missing line affected real households. Ye found an unmapped return valve behind it.","Rejecting worker [[slavery|slavery]], she expressed [[regret|regret]] for demanding overnight labor. Chen and a mechanic checked ends [[respectively|respectively]]. A [[pink|pink]] tag needed to [[state|state]] actual flow; its [[relation|relation]] to hardware was wrong. Removing fragile [[protection|protection]], they encountered a stuck [[piston|piston]]. A [[stationery|stationery]] box fell. The liaison's [[resentment|resentment]] targeted Ye, but Chen caught a retreating worker, striking his own elbow. I lowered the camera and supported him. Evidence could stay where it was.","Water rose in a [[pint|pint]] measure; electrical [[polarity|polarity]] was reversed. A cited [[statute|statute]] could not replace shutdown. We did not [[rush|rush]] into the pit. Ye isolated power in an [[instant|instant]]. The inspector handled [[preservation|preservation]] as Chen breathed [[steadily|steadily]]. Cheng shared a [[sandwich|sandwich]]. Isolation at the [[conjunction|conjunction]] was necessary for [[prevention|prevention]]. Ye apologized without treating this rescue as erasing her signature, then requested replacement of the entire bypass, rather than another arrow.","Independent trucks kept residents supplied. Ye told He the reversed wiring was not her design, but she had signed without checking it. That admission meant future inspections must exceed her assumed plan. Chen's elbow had not reopened but needed rest. We canceled a night visit and chose surface power records. Cheng marked isolation time; I marked residents' renewed collection. Work slowed around an injured person, yet we had finally stopped a line that should never have kept supplying them."]});
